**Query #6** Who was the Director for the movie The Starling?

    SELECT people.director, nti.type, nti.title
    FROM "netflix_people" AS people
    LEFT JOIN netflix_titles_info as nti
    ON people.show_id=nti.show_id
    WHERE nti.title='The Starling';

| director       | type  | title        |
| -------------- | ----- | ------------ |
| Theodore Melfi | Movie | The Starling |

