**Query #7** What is the oldest movie in the database and what year was it made?

    SELECT title, type, release_year
    FROM "netflix_titles_info"
    WHERE type='Movie'
    ORDER BY release_year asc
    LIMIT 1;

| title   | type  | release_year |
| ------- | ----- | ------------ |
| Sankofa | Movie | 1993         |

